# Step 4: run the first call through the capability its binding names. The
# binding is the catalogue's, copied onto the call by ai://chat from the
# definition this request offered (never from the model's answer), so one
# rule dispatches every tool. The capability is declared on this chassis, so
# `cap://` answers it here, in process; from a node it would go up to the
# parent and through the grant gateway. Either way the capability's own
# rules decide what they accept.
WHEN ._check0.ok == true
  WITH name  = ._turn.tool_calls.0.binding.capability,
       input = ._turn.tool_calls.0.arguments,
       into  = "_res0"
  EXEC "cap://tool"
